```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Cart([Cart]) --> Pay[Charge payment]
    Pay --> Ok{Payment succeeded?}
    Ok -->|Yes| Reserve[Reserve inventory]
    Ok -->|No| Fail[Return payment error]
    Reserve --> Stock{Stock available?}
    Stock -->|Yes| Confirm([Confirm order])
    Stock -->|No| Refund[Refund payment]
    Refund --> Fail
    Fail --> End([End])
    Confirm --> End
```
